{"type":"text","timestamp":1790319532447,"sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","part":{"id":"prt_0d75c1992001zhSsSwWclvxTqB","messageID":"msg_0d7586c560010qBjHxyLAews0g","sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","type":"text","text":"The scene already has a `DistortionPreview` TextureRect with the icon texture; I need to add the ShaderMaterial with a VisualShader using the DistortionUV custom node. Let me first check the Godot version and then build this programmatically via a headless script (to guarantee correct VisualShader serialization).","time":{"start":1790319532434,"end":1790319532436},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_f3d11f5bbb1a4f1bb55cb793ad887ce7_msg"}}}}
