{"type":"text","timestamp":1790319673720,"sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","part":{"id":"prt_0d75e416a001RNvhpK60YAhlnw","messageID":"msg_0d75c3d8c001tS2aUAq5rAPrny","sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","type":"text","text":"Godot import works. Now I'll create a tool script that builds the VisualShader with the DistortionUV custom node (with the exact constants), attaches it via ShaderMaterial to the TextureRect, and re-saves the scene — this guarantees correct serialization of the VisualShader graph.","time":{"start":1790319673706,"end":1790319673709},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_e031a8290995477a93e8e3c9384e1861_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790319673737,"sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_8_3d4e919b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\t# --- 1. Build the VisualShader ---\n\tvar distortion_script: Script = load(\"res://addons/shaderV/uv/distortionUV.gd\")\n\n\tvar vs := VisualShader.new()\n\tvs.resource_name = \"DistortionUVVisualShader\"\n\t# Make the default entry node list empty; we only wire fragment.\n\tvar fragment_nodes: Array = vs.get_node_list(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT)\n\tvar output_node: VisualShaderNodeOutput = null\n\tvar output_id := -1\n\tfor id in fragment_nodes:\n\t\tvar n = vs.get_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, id)\n\t\tif n is VisualShaderNodeOutput:\n\t\t\toutput_node = n\n\t\t\toutput_id = id\n\tif output_node == null:\n\t\tpush_error(\"No fragment output node found in VisualShader\")\n\t\tget_scene().quit(1)\n\t\treturn\n\n\t# --- 2. Add the custom DistortionUV node ---\n\tvar dist_node: VisualShaderNodeCustom = distortion_script.new()\n\tvs.add_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, dist_node, Vector2(-420.0, 0.0))\n\tvar dist_id := -1\n\tfor id in vs.get_node_list(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT):\n\t\tif vs.get_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, id) == dist_node:\n\t\t\tdist_id = id\n\tif dist_id == -1:\n\t\tpush_error(\"DistortionUV node was not added\")\n\t\tget_scene().quit(1)\n\t\treturn\n\n\t# --- 3. Default input port values (example constants) ---\n\t# ports: 0=uv, 1=waveX, 2=waveY, 3=distortX, 4=distortY\n\tvs.set_default_port_value(VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR, dist_id, 1, 7.0)\n\tvs.set_default_port_value(VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR, dist_id, 2, 5.0)\n\tvs.set_default_port_value(VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR, dist_id, 3, 0.1)\n\tvs.set_default_port_value(VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR, dist_id, 4, 0.1)\n\n\t# --- 4. Connect distorted UV output to the fragment UV input (port 2) ---\n\tvar err := vs.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, dist_id, 0, output_id, 2)\n\tif err != OK:\n\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to connect DistortionUV output to fragment UV (err %d)\" % err)\n\t\tget_scene().quit(1)\n\t\treturn\n\n\t# --- 5. Wrap in ShaderMaterial ---\n\tvar mat := ShaderMaterial.new()\n\tmat.resource_name = \"DistortionUVShaderMaterial\"\n\tmat.shader = vs\n\n\t# --- 6. Load scene, ensure TextureRect, assign texture + material ---\n\tvar packed: PackedScene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\")\n\tvar root: Control = packed.instantiate()\n\n\tvar tr: TextureRect = root.get_node_or_null(\"DistortionPreview\")\n\tif tr == null:\n\t\ttr = TextureRect.new()\n\t\ttr.name = \"DistortionPreview\"\n\t\troot.add_child(tr)\n\t\ttr.owner = root\n\n\ttr.texture = load(\"res://addons/shaderV/shaderV_icon.png\")\n\ttr.size = Vector2(512.0, 512.0)\n\tif tr.expand_mode == TextureRect.EXPAND_KEEP_SIZE:\n\t\ttr.expand_mode = TextureRect.EXPAND_IGNORE_SIZE\n\tif tr.stretch_mode != TextureRect.STRETCH_KEEP_ASPECT_COVERED:\n\t\ttr.stretch_mode = TextureRect.STRETCH_KEEP_ASPECT_COVERED\n\ttr.material = mat\n\n\tvar new_scene := PackedScene.new()\n\tvar pack_err := new_scene.pack(root)\n\tif pack_err != OK:\n\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to pack scene (err %d)\" % pack_err)\n\t\tget_scene().quit(1)\n\t\treturn\n\tvar save_err := ResourceSaver.save(new_scene, \"res://scenes/main.tscn\")\n\tif save_err != OK:\n\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to save scene (err %d)\" % save_err)\n\t\tget_scene().quit(1)\n\t\treturn\n\n\tprint(\"BUILD_OK: scene saved with DistortionUV VisualShader material\")\n\tget_scene().quit(0)\n","filePath":"/workspace/build_shader.gd"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/build_shader.gd","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"workspace/build_shader.gd","time":{"start":1790319673715,"end":1790319673723}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_8_3d4e919b"}},"id":"prt_0d75e416e001zeYzZ567p2fVks","sessionID":"ses_f28a829c6ffeqr8YpwUp5rVdxl","messageID":"msg_0d75c3d8c001tS2aUAq5rAPrny"}}
